<div id="rubymem">
  <%= render :partial => "shared/header" %> 
  <section>
    <div class="col-sm-6 col-sm-offset-3">
      <h1>Awesome! Thanks for your help.</h1>
      <p>Your advisory has been recorded and the reviewers have been emailed. It is
      not published yet, so it will not show up in the
      <%= link_to "archive", advisories_path %> or the
      <%= link_to "feed", feed_path %> for now.</p>
      <p>What happens next: a reviewer reads it, and if it holds up they add it to
      the <a href="https://github.com/rubymem/ruby-mem-advisory-db">advisory
      database</a>. From there it is imported and appears on the site. If anything
      about your report is unclear, they will get in touch through the email
      address you gave us.</p>
      <p>Want to move it along yourself? Open a pull request against the
      <a href="https://github.com/rubymem/ruby-mem-advisory-db">advisory
      database</a> with the YAML from the preview page.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
